---
// The transcript is shaped rather than captured, so its lines follow the live
// display's formats in crates/lattice-output/src/live.rs. Re-check them there
// before editing this block. web depends on api, so web can only be a hit when
// api's key did not move.
---

<section class="px-3 py-5">
	<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 72rem;">
		<div class="mb-5" style="max-width: 40rem;">
			<h2 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
				Three languages, one short file
			</h2>
			<p class="fs-5 mb-0" style="color: var(--text-muted);">
				The Go service and the Python model sit outside the JavaScript workspace, so the
				config lists them. The web app calls the API, which no manifest can say, so the
				config says that too. Everything else comes from the repo.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="row g-4 align-items-stretch">
			<div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
				<div class="card code-card h-100">
					<div class="card-header code-card__bar">
						<span class="code-card__dot"></span>
						<span class="code-card__dot"></span>
						<span class="code-card__dot"></span>
						<span class="code-card__name">lattice.json</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-body p-0">
						<pre class="code-card__body mb-0"><code>{`{
  "workspaces": ["apps/api", "services/ml"],
  "engines": { "node": ">=22", "go": ">=1.23" },
  "overrides": {
    "web": { "dependsOn": ["api"] }
  }
}`}</code></pre>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
				<div class="card code-card h-100">
					<div class="card-header code-card__bar">
						<span class="code-card__dot"></span>
						<span class="code-card__dot"></span>
						<span class="code-card__dot"></span>
						<span class="code-card__name">terminal</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card-body p-0">
						<pre class="code-card__body mb-0"><code>{`$ lattice run build
❖ lattice  build  · 3 workspaces

  `}<span class="lattice-accent">●</span>{` api   `}<span class="lattice-accent">cached</span>{` · 1.21s saved
  `}<span class="lattice-accent">●</span>{` web   `}<span class="lattice-accent">cached</span>{` · 0.83s saved
  ✓ ml    0.44s

❖  3 tasks · 2 cached  0.46s · 2.04s saved
`}</code></pre>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.code-card {
		background: var(--surface-2);
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.code-card__bar {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.4rem;
		background: transparent;
	}
	.code-card__dot {
		width: 0.6rem;
		height: 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--border);
	}
	.code-card__name {
		margin-left: 0.5rem;
		font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}
	.code-card__body {
		padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
		font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--text);
		overflow-x: auto;
	}
</style>
